        <mxCell id="p6_c70" value="18. 200  channel=mobile  (token yok)" style="endArrow=open;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 4;strokeColor=#64748B;strokeWidth=1.2;fontSize=10;fontColor=#64748B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;edgeStyle=none;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p6_c68" target="p6_c69"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p6_c71" value="" style="shape=ellipse;perimeter=ellipsePerimeter;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1064" y="957" width="2" height="2" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p6_c72" value="" style="shape=ellipse;perimeter=ellipsePerimeter;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="494" y="957" width="2" height="2" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p6_c73" value="19. 200" style="endArrow=open;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 4;strokeColor=#64748B;strokeWidth=1.2;fontSize=10;fontColor=#64748B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;edgeStyle=none;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p6_c71" target="p6_c72"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p6_c74" value="" style="shape=ellipse;perimeter=ellipsePerimeter;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="494" y="1003" width="2" height="2" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p6_c75" value="" style="shape=ellipse;perimeter=ellipsePerimeter;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="304" y="1003" width="2" height="2" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p6_c76" value="20. 200" style="endArrow=open;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 4;strokeColor=#64748B;strokeWidth=1.2;fontSize=10;fontColor=#64748B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;edgeStyle=none;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p6_c74" target="p6_c75"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p6_c77" value="" style="shape=ellipse;perimeter=ellipsePerimeter;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="304" y="1049" width="2" height="2" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p6_c78" value="" style="shape=ellipse;perimeter=ellipsePerimeter;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="114" y="1049" width="2" height="2" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p6_c79" value="21. 200" style="endArrow=open;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 4;strokeColor=#64748B;strokeWidth=1.2;fontSize=10;fontColor=#64748B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;edgeStyle=none;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p6_c77" target="p6_c78"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p6_c80" value="KONTROLLER: K1 dış token yalnız DMZ'de; iç token yalnız DMZ→iç bağlantıda. K2 oturum iptali exchange'de (adım 8). K3 kısıtlı token ext-authz'da engellenir (adım 5).&lt;br&gt;LAB → PROD: iç BFF ↔ core düz HTTP (mevcut açık). İşlem onayı (transfer imzası) Seal Mobile/Intranet akışına bağlı değil; stub." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;fontSize=10;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1120" width="1460" height="76" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p6_c81" value="Adım legend'ı&lt;br&gt;1. [Mobil uygulama] -&gt; [HAProxy]: 1. GET /bff/mobile/accounts  Bearer &lt;IdP token&gt;  DPoP: &lt;proof&gt;&lt;br&gt;2. [HAProxy] -&gt; [kgateway gw-mobile]: 2. TLS re-encrypt&lt;br&gt;3. [kgateway gw-mobile] -&gt; [ext-authz]: 3. ext-authz: X-Dmz-Channel=mobile, Authorization, DPoP, Host&lt;br&gt;4. [ext-authz] kendi içinde: 4. RS256, channel=mobile, cnf zorunlu; DPoP proof doğrula&lt;br&gt;5. [ext-authz] kendi içinde: 5. KISIT: restricted=true veya scope=activation → 403 (iş API'sine girmez)&lt;br&gt;6. [ext-authz] -&gt; [kgateway gw-internal]: 6. token exchange (mTLS CN=dmz-exchange-mobile), subject = dış token&lt;br&gt;7. [kgateway gw-internal] -&gt; [Spring IdP]: 7. /token grant=token-exchange  audience=kgateway-internal&lt;br&gt;8. [Spring IdP] kendi içinde: 8. subject imzası + OTURUM AKTİF mi (kayıt yoksa invalid_grant)&lt;br&gt;9. [Spring IdP] kendi içinde: 9. iç JWT: aud=kgateway-internal, channel=mobile, azp=dmz-exchange-mobile&lt;br&gt;10. [Spring IdP] -&gt; [kgateway gw-internal]: 10. iç JWT&lt;br&gt;11. [kgateway gw-internal] -&gt; [ext-authz]: 11. iç JWT&lt;br&gt;12. [ext-authz] -&gt; [kgateway gw-mobile]: 12. 200 + Authorization: Bearer &lt;iç JWT&gt;  (dış token iç ağa gitmez)&lt;br&gt;13. [kgateway gw-mobile] -&gt; [kgateway gw-internal]: 13. GET /bff/mobile/accounts + iç JWT (mTLS DMZ)&lt;br&gt;14. [kgateway gw-internal] kendi içinde: 14. iç JWT, RBAC: x-channel ∈ {web, mobile}&lt;br&gt;15. [kgateway gw-internal] -&gt; [app-bff]: 15. forwardToken: iç JWT&lt;br&gt;16. [app-bff] -&gt; [core app-core]: 16. hesap sorgusu (iç JWT)&lt;br&gt;17. [core app-core] -&gt; [app-bff]: 17. hesaplar&lt;br&gt;18. [app-bff] -&gt; [kgateway gw-internal]: 18. 200  channel=mobile  (token yok)&lt;br&gt;19. [kgateway gw-internal] -&gt; [kgateway gw-mobile]: 19. 200&lt;br&gt;20. [kgateway gw-mobile] -&gt; [HAProxy]: 20. 200&lt;br&gt;21. [HAProxy] -&gt; [Mobil uygulama]: 21. 200" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;fontSize=10;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1212" width="1460" height="362" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p6_c82" value="&lt;span style='color:#334155'&gt;━━ istek&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style='color:#94A3B8'&gt;╍╍ yanıt&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style='color:#B91C1C'&gt;&lt;b&gt;━━ iç JWT (yalnız iç ağda)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style='color:#9CA3AF'&gt;╍╍ planlı / prod&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1588" width="1000" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram id="p7" name="V2 M5 Yeni cihaz: OTP + aktivasyon + kısıtlı token">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="900" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1291" pageHeight="2146" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
