        <mxCell id="p8_c45" value="10. POST /token  code + code_verifier  client_secret (Basic)" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=1.4;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1F2937;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;edgeStyle=none;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p8_c43" target="p8_c44"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p8_c46" value="11. TEK AKTİF GİRİŞ: alice'in mobil oturumları silinir" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;fillColor=#DBEAFE;strokeColor=#1D4ED8;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="881" y="576" width="180" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p8_c47" value="12. access_token: channel=web, aud=channel-web, auth_method=pwd_otp" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;fillColor=#DBEAFE;strokeColor=#1D4ED8;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="881" y="622" width="180" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p8_c48" value="" style="shape=ellipse;perimeter=ellipsePerimeter;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="874" y="681" width="2" height="2" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p8_c49" value="" style="shape=ellipse;perimeter=ellipsePerimeter;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="114" y="681" width="2" height="2" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p8_c50" value="13. access_token + refresh_token" style="endArrow=open;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 4;strokeColor=#64748B;strokeWidth=1.2;fontSize=10;fontColor=#64748B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;edgeStyle=none;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p8_c48" target="p8_c49"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p8_c51" value="KONTROLLER: K1 parola yalnız IdP'de (mobil ile aynı kaynak). K2 web-app gizli anahtarla (Basic), PKCE zorunlu. K3 yeni giriş mobil oturumu düşürür.&lt;br&gt;LAB → PROD: web için BFF oturum deseni (D-10) henüz yok; token tarayıcıda. CSRF ve oturum süresi prod'da sıkılaşmalı." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;fontSize=10;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="752" width="890" height="76" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p8_c52" value="Adım legend'ı&lt;br&gt;1. [Tarayıcı] -&gt; [HAProxy]: 1. GET /realms/bank/.../auth  client_id=web-app  code_challenge (S256)&lt;br&gt;2. [HAProxy] -&gt; [kgateway gw-web]: 2. TLS re-encrypt&lt;br&gt;3. [kgateway gw-web] -&gt; [kgateway gw-internal]: 3. route /realms/ (web-login)  mTLS&lt;br&gt;4. [kgateway gw-internal] -&gt; [Spring IdP]: 4. authorization endpoint&lt;br&gt;5. [Spring IdP] -&gt; [Tarayıcı]: 5. 302 /login (JSESSIONID)&lt;br&gt;6. [Tarayıcı] -&gt; [HAProxy]: 6. GET /login  →  form (_csrf)&lt;br&gt;7. [Tarayıcı] -&gt; [HAProxy]: 7. POST /login  username=alice  parola (YALNIZ IdP'de)  _csrf&lt;br&gt;8. [Spring IdP] kendi içinde: 8. parola BCrypt doğrula (JdbcUserDetailsManager)&lt;br&gt;9. [Spring IdP] -&gt; [Tarayıcı]: 9. 302 → auth (devam) → callback?code=...&lt;br&gt;10. [Tarayıcı] -&gt; [HAProxy]: 10. POST /token  code + code_verifier  client_secret (Basic)&lt;br&gt;11. [Spring IdP] kendi içinde: 11. TEK AKTİF GİRİŞ: alice'in mobil oturumları silinir&lt;br&gt;12. [Spring IdP] kendi içinde: 12. access_token: channel=web, aud=channel-web, auth_method=pwd_otp&lt;br&gt;13. [Spring IdP] -&gt; [Tarayıcı]: 13. access_token + refresh_token" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;fontSize=10;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="844" width="1000" height="234" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p8_c53" value="&lt;span style='color:#334155'&gt;━━ istek&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style='color:#94A3B8'&gt;╍╍ yanıt&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style='color:#B91C1C'&gt;&lt;b&gt;━━ iç JWT (yalnız iç ağda)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style='color:#9CA3AF'&gt;╍╍ planlı / prod&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1092" width="1000" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
