        <mxCell id="p11_c109" value="" style="shape=ellipse;perimeter=ellipsePerimeter;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1064" y="1687" width="2" height="2" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p11_c110" value="" style="shape=ellipse;perimeter=ellipsePerimeter;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="684" y="1687" width="2" height="2" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p11_c111" value="32. timestamp" style="endArrow=open;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 4;strokeColor=#64748B;strokeWidth=1.2;fontSize=10;fontColor=#64748B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;edgeStyle=none;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p11_c109" target="p11_c110"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p11_c112" value="" style="shape=ellipse;perimeter=ellipsePerimeter;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="684" y="1733" width="2" height="2" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p11_c113" value="" style="shape=ellipse;perimeter=ellipsePerimeter;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="304" y="1733" width="2" height="2" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p11_c114" value="33. Set-Cookie: SID=sessionId" style="endArrow=open;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 4;strokeColor=#64748B;strokeWidth=1.2;fontSize=10;fontColor=#64748B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;edgeStyle=none;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p11_c112" target="p11_c113"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p11_c115" value="VENDOR REFERANS: bu akış Seal v3 hedef tasarımıdır. Bizde PIN ana kimlik değildir; parola IdP'de, PIN cihaz içi ikincil faktördür.&lt;br&gt;KAYNAK NOTU: 'pinExpired' bloğu opsiyonel. Yanıt 'flowId' adım 26'da SDK'ya döner; 'clientPasswordToken' kaynakta tanımsız.&lt;br&gt;BİZİM FARK: login/begin IdP token + DPoP ister; SID IdP token'ına bağlıdır; yeni cihaz/OTP adımı bizde yok." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;fontSize=10;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1804" width="1270" height="106" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p11_c116" value="Adım legend'ı&lt;br&gt;1. [Bank App / Bank SDK] -&gt; [Seal SDK]: 1. login(userId, clientExtras)&lt;br&gt;2. [Seal SDK] -&gt; [Seal Mobile]: 2. begin login &amp; security check&lt;br&gt;3. [Seal Mobile] -&gt; [Seal SDK]: 3. KPu_PIN (geçici PIN transport anahtarı)&lt;br&gt;4. [Seal SDK] -&gt; [Bank App / Bank SDK]: 4. pinPrompter.onPinRequest(params, handler)&lt;br&gt;5. [Kullanıcı] -&gt; [Bank App / Bank SDK]: 5. kullanıcı PIN girer&lt;br&gt;6. [Bank App / Bank SDK] -&gt; [Seal SDK]: 6. handler.onPinAcquired(pin)&lt;br&gt;7. [Seal SDK] -&gt; [Seal Mobile]: 7. verifyUserPin(PIN_ENC)&lt;br&gt;8. [Seal Mobile] kendi içinde: 8. PIN_Hash = decrypt(KPr_PIN, PIN_ENC_Transport)&lt;br&gt;9. [Seal Mobile] -&gt; [Password Manager]: 9. verifyPassword(userId, password, clientInfo, clientExtras)&lt;br&gt;10. [Password Manager] kendi içinde: 10. salted hash; PIN_ENC == PIN_DB&lt;br&gt;11. [Password Manager] -&gt; [Seal Mobile]: 11. ownerId, status, clientExtras&lt;br&gt;12. [Seal Mobile] kendi içinde: 12. authorizationId = createAuthorization(fingerprint)&lt;br&gt;13. [Seal Mobile] -&gt; [Seal SDK]: 13. pt = JWE(KPu_User: authorizationId, pinExpired, clientPasswordToken)&lt;br&gt;14. [Seal SDK] kendi içinde: 14. decrypt_jwe; JWS = sign_jws(KPr_User, authorizationId, clientPasswordToken)&lt;br&gt;15. [Seal SDK] -&gt; [Seal Mobile]: 15. authorizeTransaction(authorizationId, JWS)&lt;br&gt;16. [Seal Mobile] kendi içinde: 16. challenge (cihaz + sahip, süre, tek kullanım); zincir; imza; WYS; cihaz bağlama; nonce&lt;br&gt;17. [Seal Mobile] -&gt; [Seal SDK]: 17. success&lt;br&gt;18. [Seal SDK] -&gt; [Bank App / Bank SDK]: 18. pinPrompter: NEW_PIN iste&lt;br&gt;19. [Kullanıcı] -&gt; [Bank App / Bank SDK]: 19. kullanıcı NEW_PIN girer&lt;br&gt;20. [Bank App / Bank SDK] -&gt; [Seal SDK]: 20. onPinAcquired(pin)&lt;br&gt;21. [Seal SDK] -&gt; [Seal Mobile]: 21. changePin(PIN_ENC_Transport, NEW_PIN_ENC)&lt;br&gt;22. [Seal Mobile] kendi içinde: 22. MFA bu oturumda yapıldı mı? NEW_PIN çöz&lt;br&gt;23. [Seal Mobile] -&gt; [Password Manager]: 23. changePassword(userId, current, new, validityPeriod, clientInfo, clientExtras)&lt;br&gt;24. [Password Manager] -&gt; [Seal Mobile]: 24. ownerId, status, clientExtras&lt;br&gt;25. [Seal Mobile] -&gt; [Seal SDK]: 25. status, clientExtras&lt;br&gt;26. [Seal SDK] -&gt; [Bank App / Bank SDK]: 26. flowId, clientExtras&lt;br&gt;27. [Bank App / Bank SDK] -&gt; [Bank Backend]: 27. authenticateSession(flowId, clientExtras)&lt;br&gt;28. [Bank Backend] -&gt; [Seal Intranet]: 28. POST /v3/getLoginStatus {flowId}&lt;br&gt;29. [Seal Intranet] -&gt; [Bank Backend]: 29. ownerId, status, remainingTime, pinLockStatus, deviceLockStatus&lt;br&gt;30. [Bank Backend] kendi içinde: 30. sessionId = createSession()&lt;br&gt;31. [Bank Backend] -&gt; [Seal Intranet]: 31. POST /v3/createTimestamp {flowId}&lt;br&gt;32. [Seal Intranet] -&gt; [Bank Backend]: 32. timestamp&lt;br&gt;33. [Bank Backend] -&gt; [Bank App / Bank SDK]: 33. Set-Cookie: SID=sessionId" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;fontSize=10;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1926" width="1270" height="554" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p11_c117" value="&lt;span style='color:#334155'&gt;━━ istek&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style='color:#94A3B8'&gt;╍╍ yanıt&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style='color:#B91C1C'&gt;&lt;b&gt;━━ iç JWT (yalnız iç ağda)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style='color:#9CA3AF'&gt;╍╍ planlı / prod&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="2494" width="1000" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
