        <mxCell id="p12_c103" value="" style="shape=ellipse;perimeter=ellipsePerimeter;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="304" y="1569" width="2" height="2" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p12_c104" value="27. success" style="endArrow=open;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 4;strokeColor=#64748B;strokeWidth=1.2;fontSize=10;fontColor=#64748B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;edgeStyle=none;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p12_c102" target="p12_c103"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p12_c105" value="28. oturumu geçersiz kıl" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;fillColor=#DBEAFE;strokeColor=#1D4ED8;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="691" y="1602" width="180" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p12_c106" value="" style="shape=ellipse;perimeter=ellipsePerimeter;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="684" y="1661" width="2" height="2" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p12_c107" value="" style="shape=ellipse;perimeter=ellipsePerimeter;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="304" y="1661" width="2" height="2" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p12_c108" value="29. error" style="endArrow=open;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 4;strokeColor=#64748B;strokeWidth=1.2;fontSize=10;fontColor=#64748B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;edgeStyle=none;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p12_c106" target="p12_c107"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p12_c109" value="VENDOR REFERANS: bu akış Seal v3 hedef tasarımıdır. Bizde PIN ana kimlik değildir; parola IdP'de, PIN cihaz içi ikincil faktördür.&lt;br&gt;KAYNAK NOTU: vendor diyagramında 'sendSmsOtp' SMS gönderir; bizim kuralımız demo OTP'nin ekranda gösterilmesi ve SMS gönderilmemesidir.&lt;br&gt;BİZİM FARK: yeni cihaz tespiti ve PIN_EXPIRED ayrımı bizde yok; giriş PIN_AUTHORIZED olunca SID veriliyor." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;fontSize=10;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1778" width="1270" height="106" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p12_c110" value="Adım legend'ı&lt;br&gt;1. [Bank App / Bank SDK] -&gt; [Seal SDK]: 1. login(params: userId, ownerId, tckn, userCode)&lt;br&gt;2. [Seal SDK] -&gt; [Seal Mobile]: 2. begin login &amp; security checks&lt;br&gt;3. [Seal Mobile] -&gt; [Seal SDK]: 3. KPu_PIN&lt;br&gt;4. [Seal SDK] -&gt; [Bank App / Bank SDK]: 4. pinPrompter.onPinRequest(params, handler)&lt;br&gt;5. [Kullanıcı] -&gt; [Bank App / Bank SDK]: 5. kullanıcı PIN girer&lt;br&gt;6. [Bank App / Bank SDK] -&gt; [Seal SDK]: 6. onPinAcquired(pin)&lt;br&gt;7. [Seal SDK] -&gt; [Seal Mobile]: 7. validateUserPin(PIN_ENC)&lt;br&gt;8. [Seal Mobile] kendi içinde: 8. PIN_Hash = decrypt(KPr_PIN, PIN_ENC_Transport)&lt;br&gt;9. [Seal Mobile] -&gt; [Password Manager]: 9. verifyPassword(userId, password, clientInfo, clientExtras)&lt;br&gt;10. [Password Manager] kendi içinde: 10. salted hash; PIN_ENC == PIN_DB&lt;br&gt;11. [Password Manager] -&gt; [Seal Mobile]: 11. ownerId, status, clientExtras&lt;br&gt;12. [Seal Mobile] -&gt; [Seal SDK]: 12. flowId, clientExtras&lt;br&gt;13. [Seal SDK] -&gt; [Bank App / Bank SDK]: 13. flowId, clientExtras&lt;br&gt;14. [Bank App / Bank SDK] -&gt; [Bank Backend]: 14. authenticateSession(flowId, clientExtras)&lt;br&gt;15. [Bank Backend] -&gt; [Seal Intranet]: 15. POST /v3/getLoginStatus {flowId}&lt;br&gt;16. [Seal Intranet] -&gt; [Bank Backend]: 16. ownerId, status, remainingTime, pinLockStatus, deviceLockStatus&lt;br&gt;17. [Bank Backend] kendi içinde: 17. sendSmsOtp() veya 2FA (ör. başka Seal cihazında authorization)&lt;br&gt;18. [Bank Backend] -&gt; [Bank App / Bank SDK]: 18. displayOtpScreen()&lt;br&gt;19. [Kullanıcı] -&gt; [Bank App / Bank SDK]: 19. SMS OTP girer&lt;br&gt;20. [Bank App / Bank SDK] -&gt; [Bank Backend]: 20. smsOtp&lt;br&gt;21. [Bank Backend] kendi içinde: 21. SMS OTP / 2FA doğrula&lt;br&gt;22. [Bank Backend] -&gt; [Bank App / Bank SDK]: 22. Set-Cookie: SID=sessionId&lt;br&gt;23. [Bank App / Bank SDK] -&gt; [Bank Backend]: 23. activationCompleted()  (session: activationToken)&lt;br&gt;24. [Bank Backend] -&gt; [Seal Intranet]: 24. POST /v3/getActivationStatus {activationToken}&lt;br&gt;25. [Seal Intranet] -&gt; [Bank Backend]: 25. ownerId, status, remainingTime&lt;br&gt;26. [Bank Backend] kendi içinde: 26. oturum kısıtını kaldır&lt;br&gt;27. [Bank Backend] -&gt; [Bank App / Bank SDK]: 27. success&lt;br&gt;28. [Bank Backend] kendi içinde: 28. oturumu geçersiz kıl&lt;br&gt;29. [Bank Backend] -&gt; [Bank App / Bank SDK]: 29. error" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;fontSize=10;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1900" width="1270" height="490" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p12_c111" value="&lt;span style='color:#334155'&gt;━━ istek&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style='color:#94A3B8'&gt;╍╍ yanıt&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style='color:#B91C1C'&gt;&lt;b&gt;━━ iç JWT (yalnız iç ağda)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style='color:#9CA3AF'&gt;╍╍ planlı / prod&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="2404" width="1000" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
