        <mxCell id="p13_c88" value="21. POST /v3/getActivationStatus {activationToken}" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;strokeColor=#334155;strokeWidth=1.4;fontSize=10;fontColor=#1F2937;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;edgeStyle=none;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p13_c86" target="p13_c87"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p13_c89" value="" style="shape=ellipse;perimeter=ellipsePerimeter;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1064" y="1207" width="2" height="2" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p13_c90" value="" style="shape=ellipse;perimeter=ellipsePerimeter;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="684" y="1207" width="2" height="2" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p13_c91" value="22. ownerId, status, remainingTime" style="endArrow=open;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=5 4;strokeColor=#64748B;strokeWidth=1.2;fontSize=10;fontColor=#64748B;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;edgeStyle=none;" edge="1" parent="1" source="p13_c89" target="p13_c90"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p13_c92" value="VENDOR REFERANS: bu akış Seal v3 hedef tasarımıdır. Bizde PIN ana kimlik değildir; parola IdP'de, PIN cihaz içi ikincil faktördür.&lt;br&gt;KAYNAK NOTU: 'hashSated' yazım hatası (hashSalted kabul edildi). Aktivasyon 'mTLS anahtarları' adımında hangi anahtarların üretildiği tanımsız.&lt;br&gt;BİZİM FARK: aktivasyon token'ı ve MFA şartı bizde korumasız (bank-backend /activation/*). Cihaz kaydı (enroll) PIN'i aktivasyondan bağımsız kaydediyor." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;fontSize=10;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1278" width="1270" height="106" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p13_c93" value="Adım legend'ı&lt;br&gt;1. [Bank App / Bank SDK] -&gt; [Bank Backend]: 1. activate(userIdentifiers)&lt;br&gt;2. [Bank Backend] -&gt; [Seal Intranet]: 2. POST /v3/createActivationToken {ownerId, userIdentifiers, pinRequestType}&lt;br&gt;3. [Seal Intranet] -&gt; [Bank Backend]: 3. activationToken&lt;br&gt;4. [Bank Backend] -&gt; [Bank App / Bank SDK]: 4. activationToken (oturumda ve/veya DB'de saklanır)&lt;br&gt;5. [Bank App / Bank SDK] -&gt; [Seal SDK]: 5. activate(activationToken, pinPrompter, sealListener)&lt;br&gt;6. [Seal SDK] -&gt; [Seal Mobile]: 6. begin activation&lt;br&gt;7. [Seal Mobile] -&gt; [Seal SDK]: 7. mTLS anahtarları&lt;br&gt;8. [Seal SDK] -&gt; [Seal Mobile]: 8. security checks&lt;br&gt;9. [Seal Mobile] -&gt; [Seal SDK]: 9. KPu_PIN&lt;br&gt;10. [Seal SDK] -&gt; [Bank App / Bank SDK]: 10. pinPrompter.onPinRequest(params, handler)&lt;br&gt;11. [Kullanıcı] -&gt; [Bank App / Bank SDK]: 11. kullanıcı NEW_PIN girer&lt;br&gt;12. [Bank App / Bank SDK] -&gt; [Seal SDK]: 12. onPinAcquired(pin)&lt;br&gt;13. [Seal SDK] -&gt; [Seal Mobile]: 13. activateDevice(PIN_ENC_Transport)&lt;br&gt;14. [Seal Mobile] kendi içinde: 14. newPassword = decrypt(KPr_PIN, NEW_PIN_ENC_Transport)&lt;br&gt;15. [Seal Mobile] -&gt; [Password Manager]: 15. setPassword(userId, newPassword, validityPeriod, clientInfo, clientExtras)&lt;br&gt;16. [Password Manager] kendi içinde: 16. NEW_PIN_SaltedHash = hash(newPassword); NEW_PIN_ENC = encrypt(Ks_PM, ...); store&lt;br&gt;17. [Password Manager] -&gt; [Seal Mobile]: 17. ownerId, status, clientExtras&lt;br&gt;18. [Seal Mobile] -&gt; [Seal SDK]: 18. activationStatus, clientExtras&lt;br&gt;19. [Seal SDK] -&gt; [Bank App / Bank SDK]: 19. activationStatus, clientExtras&lt;br&gt;20. [Bank App / Bank SDK] -&gt; [Bank Backend]: 20. activationCompleted()  (session: activationToken)&lt;br&gt;21. [Bank Backend] -&gt; [Seal Intranet]: 21. POST /v3/getActivationStatus {activationToken}&lt;br&gt;22. [Seal Intranet] -&gt; [Bank Backend]: 22. ownerId, status, remainingTime" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;fontSize=10;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1400" width="1270" height="378" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="p13_c94" value="&lt;span style='color:#334155'&gt;━━ istek&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style='color:#94A3B8'&gt;╍╍ yanıt&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style='color:#B91C1C'&gt;&lt;b&gt;━━ iç JWT (yalnız iç ağda)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style='color:#9CA3AF'&gt;╍╍ planlı / prod&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;fontSize=11;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1792" width="1000" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
